/P 53 0 R
/E (improves quality of life, and SDG 9 was the most closely associated with the field \(76%\), followed by SDGs 4 \(32%\) and 16 \(12%\). It is concluded that while basic protection practices are being adopted, a gap remains between knowing the law and feeling secure, which reinforces the need for digital education initiatives. The results describe the surveyed group and should not be generalized. )
